  <name>Resonance</name>
  <summary>EQ for PipeWire with FxSound and EqualizerAPO presets</summary>

  <description>
    <p>
      Resonance is a terminal and desktop equalizer daemon for Linux and
      PipeWire. It captures system audio, runs it through a high-precision DSP
      chain (parametric EQ plus FxSound-style Fidelity, Ambience, Surround,
      Dynamic Boost and Bass effects), and plays the processed audio back.
    </p>
    <p>
      It loads FxSound .fac presets and EqualizerAPO .txt configs, imports
      AutoEq headphone corrections, and can map output devices to profiles so
      the right EQ follows your headphones.
    </p>
  </description>

  <launchable type="desktop-id">io.github.ealtun21.Resonance.desktop</launchable>

